@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-03  Reset a forgotten password
' Requirements: ACC-05 ACC-13 ACC-14 ACC-16 NOTICE-02
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Account holder" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
U -> S: Request password reset for an email
S --> U: Same acknowledgment whether or not account exists
opt Eligible existing account
  S --> U: Email a single-use reset link
  note over U,S
  Link expires after 30 minutes.
  A newer reset request invalidates older links.
  end note
  U -> S: Open reset link and submit new password
  alt Expired, superseded, or already used link
    S --> U: Reject reset; allow a new reset request
  else Valid link and acceptable password
    S --> U: Confirm password change; require sign-in again
    note over S
    End all existing sessions.
    Preserve role, approval status, deactivation state,
    and all learning records.
    end note
  end
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-03 | Product behavior
@enduml
